cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use primerpicker, please cite it as below."
title: primerpicker
abstract: >-
  An interactive tool to design and check PCR and sequencing primers,
  with a graphical and a command-line interface. Version 1 reproduces
  the features, default values and results of Primer Designer 2.0
  (Scientific & Educational Software, 1990-1991).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Frédéric
    family-names: Mahé
repository-code: "https://github.com/frederic-mahe/primerpicker"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - PCR
  - primer design
  - sequencing primers
  - bioinformatics
